1
00:02:00,502 --> 00:02:03,339
You look like you've had a rough day, Asalar.

2
00:02:04,298 --> 00:02:05,341
Shedar...

3
00:02:06,091 --> 00:02:08,052
It's a pleasure to see you again.

4
00:02:08,218 --> 00:02:11,847
You haven't come to see me in a long time.

5
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:17,478
But I think I've always given you a warm welcome, have I not?

6
00:02:17,645 --> 00:02:18,479
Honestly,

7
00:02:19,521 --> 00:02:22,983
I've always been scared of you and your illness doesn't help.

8
00:02:23,901 --> 00:02:26,945
I don't understand why my mother keeps you so close.

9
00:02:27,112 --> 00:02:29,865
You'll burn or contaminate her one day.

10
00:02:30,908 --> 00:02:34,244
Are you aware she's the one responsible for my condition?

11
00:02:35,788 --> 00:02:37,665
If only she were reasonable

12
00:02:37,831 --> 00:02:41,001
and didn't use the magic of my Dofus as often,

13
00:02:41,168 --> 00:02:43,253
I wouldn't have become this weak.

14
00:02:44,004 --> 00:02:47,883
Truth be told, I'm now just a shadow of myself.

15
00:02:51,679 --> 00:02:54,431
Without me, your mother wouldn't be who she is today.

16
00:02:54,598 --> 00:02:56,642
She owes me everything,

17
00:02:56,809 --> 00:02:59,770
and she wouldn't dare pretend otherwise.

18
00:03:01,230 --> 00:03:02,231
Why are you here?

19
00:03:02,398 --> 00:03:05,651
You must have a good reason, given how much you hate me.

20
00:03:06,151 --> 00:03:09,405
Asalar, I know you've just come from Brassica.

21
00:03:09,780 --> 00:03:11,156
Yes, I have. And?

22
00:03:11,740 --> 00:03:14,159
Have you found the heir?

23
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:15,911
Yes.

24
00:03:18,747 --> 00:03:20,541
And did you...

25
00:03:20,707 --> 00:03:22,418
Not yet, no.

26
00:03:22,584 --> 00:03:26,296
General Marmite and Joris got in my way.

27
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:29,466
It turns out that those two damn conspirators

28
00:03:29,633 --> 00:03:33,429
have been hiding Kannell's son in that village for more than 15 years.

29
00:03:34,054 --> 00:03:36,682
So that means my dream was a premonition.

30
00:03:36,849 --> 00:03:38,684
It was neither a dream nor premonition!

31
00:03:39,435 --> 00:03:43,313
My brother, Dardondakal, is the one who sent you that vision.

32
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,815
What are you saying?

33
00:03:45,399 --> 00:03:48,152
He's clever. He pops into your mind,

34
00:03:48,318 --> 00:03:50,946
scatters a few truths among a thousand lies,

35
00:03:51,113 --> 00:03:54,908
and you end up all fired up as if endowed with a divine mission.

36
00:03:55,075 --> 00:03:59,204
So leave the prophecy and destiny bunk to fools.

37
00:04:03,459 --> 00:04:05,794
Don't fall for it.

38
00:04:05,961 --> 00:04:09,214
Only your mother's will matters. Don't forget that.

39
00:04:09,381 --> 00:04:10,549
I understand.

40
00:04:10,716 --> 00:04:13,844
It's just, this boy is family. He's my cousin.

41
00:04:14,636 --> 00:04:17,473
Couldn't we lock him up instead of killing him?

42
00:04:17,931 --> 00:04:20,559
He will always be a threat.

43
00:04:20,726 --> 00:04:25,355
And do you really think that your solution would be...

44
00:04:26,482 --> 00:04:27,858
more humane?

45
00:04:29,485 --> 00:04:30,861
Um, well...

46
00:04:31,487 --> 00:04:33,197
Leave me now.

47
00:04:33,906 --> 00:04:36,742
I have to finish what I started

48
00:04:36,909 --> 00:04:39,578
so I don't upset your mother.

49
00:04:49,713 --> 00:04:51,632
You need to understand

50
00:04:51,799 --> 00:04:54,885
that ruling a kingdom means making difficult decisions

51
00:04:55,427 --> 00:04:56,970
for the greater good.

52
00:04:59,556 --> 00:05:00,933
I understand,

53
00:05:01,266 --> 00:05:02,392
Mother.

54
00:05:27,543 --> 00:05:29,670
Show yourself, Sipho!

55
00:05:35,217 --> 00:05:36,176
Hello, Father.

56
00:05:36,677 --> 00:05:39,680
I'm glad to see you again after all these years.

57
00:05:39,847 --> 00:05:44,184
I'd like you to keep your true appearance when you address me.

58
00:05:45,185 --> 00:05:47,688
Yes, Father. You're right. Sorry.

59
00:05:53,360 --> 00:05:54,945
That's better.

60
00:05:55,112 --> 00:05:57,155
I have a mission for you, Sipho.

61
00:05:57,322 --> 00:06:00,701
A mission that will let you explore the world again.

62
00:06:01,285 --> 00:06:02,953
Really, Father? You're serious?

63
00:06:03,370 --> 00:06:07,082
Yes. I need your skills as a tracker.

64
00:06:11,169 --> 00:06:14,047
That's... That's the blood of a young boy.

65
00:06:14,548 --> 00:06:16,842
He has the same scent as the queen and prince.

66
00:06:17,009 --> 00:06:18,594
Find him for me

67
00:06:19,511 --> 00:06:21,221
and eliminate him.

68
00:06:21,388 --> 00:06:23,098
If you succeed,

69
00:06:23,265 --> 00:06:25,684
I might present you to the queen

70
00:06:25,851 --> 00:06:28,103
so she can reward you.

71
00:06:28,604 --> 00:06:29,605
You'd do that?

72
00:06:30,397 --> 00:06:32,441
Very well, Father! As you command!

73
00:06:43,243 --> 00:06:45,913
What a joy it is to feel alive!

74
00:07:29,665 --> 00:07:31,124
Here, Welsh.

75
00:07:35,504 --> 00:07:37,422
It smells... like licorice.

76
00:07:37,589 --> 00:07:40,175
Yes. It was my Aunt Bakara's favorite tea.

77
00:07:40,717 --> 00:07:41,843
Bakara?

78
00:07:42,010 --> 00:07:43,553
Khan's wife.

79
00:07:43,929 --> 00:07:45,847
And our mother!

80
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:56,441
Well, isn't that classy!

81
00:07:57,693 --> 00:08:00,195
Our little king sure has served up a feast!

82
00:08:00,821 --> 00:08:02,531
It was just an omelet.

83
00:08:02,698 --> 00:08:06,034
You should taste his pies, his pot-au-feu, and his gratins.

84
00:08:06,201 --> 00:08:07,828
You wouldn't believe your taste buds!

85
00:08:07,995 --> 00:08:10,997
Anytime, anytime. I'd be delighted.

86
00:08:14,376 --> 00:08:16,044
I see it runs in the family.

87
00:08:16,211 --> 00:08:18,839
A signature of sorts. It's our calling card!

88
00:08:19,381 --> 00:08:22,009
Exactly. Gobbowl players have to be careful

89
00:08:22,175 --> 00:08:24,594
not to have too much gas in their stomachs.

90
00:08:25,679 --> 00:08:28,849
Seems like gobbowl is an excuse for everything.

91
00:08:33,562 --> 00:08:34,396
Kitt?

92
00:08:34,563 --> 00:08:36,356
How are you here, furball?

93
00:08:39,776 --> 00:08:43,613
I don't understand. I didn't see him jump into the portal.

94
00:08:44,489 --> 00:08:46,491
How did you find us?

95
00:08:49,703 --> 00:08:50,871
Huh, kitty?

96
00:08:51,246 --> 00:08:53,373
Is that furball really your cat?

97
00:08:53,915 --> 00:08:55,667
Yes. His name is Kitt.

98
00:08:55,834 --> 00:09:00,380
Mama says that he's been watching over me and following me since I was born.

99
00:09:01,006 --> 00:09:02,841
Me, I would say it's more like

100
00:09:03,008 --> 00:09:05,594
he's been persecuting me since I was born.

101
00:09:05,761 --> 00:09:08,680
But as they say, you can't choose your family!

102
00:09:09,890 --> 00:09:12,225
Speaking of family, Mister Joris,

103
00:09:12,392 --> 00:09:14,644
I think I'm ready to hear your story.

104
00:09:15,020 --> 00:09:16,229
Of course.

105
00:09:20,108 --> 00:09:23,904
It's more yours than mine, Welsh. Our enemy is the powerful Zabelle.

106
00:09:24,613 --> 00:09:25,906
The black queen.

107
00:09:26,406 --> 00:09:28,325
She reigns over two nations,

108
00:09:28,492 --> 00:09:31,495
Amakna and Bonta.

109
00:09:31,661 --> 00:09:35,415
And is probably one of the most powerful beings in the world.

110
00:09:36,124 --> 00:09:38,960
They call her the black queen

111
00:09:39,127 --> 00:09:42,756
because she is linked with the black dragon, Grougalorasalar.

112
00:09:42,923 --> 00:09:44,925
"Asalar" to his friends.

113
00:09:45,383 --> 00:09:47,677
The monster who attacked us in Brassica.

114
00:09:47,844 --> 00:09:49,387
Exactly.

115
00:09:49,971 --> 00:09:54,309
The only reason we survived is because he's been weakened by illness.

116
00:09:55,101 --> 00:09:58,063
Asalar obeys Zabelle completely,

117
00:09:58,230 --> 00:10:00,857
and she has only one goal:

118
00:10:01,233 --> 00:10:04,194
rule the World of Twelve.

119
00:10:04,861 --> 00:10:07,697
I don't understand. What that's got to do with me?

120
00:10:09,115 --> 00:10:13,203
Your father's name was Kannell Sheran Sharm.

121
00:10:13,703 --> 00:10:15,539
He was the king of Bonta

122
00:10:15,705 --> 00:10:19,000
and perhaps one of the greatest heroes the world has known.

123
00:10:19,167 --> 00:10:21,044
Queen Zabelle

124
00:10:21,211 --> 00:10:22,462
was his sister.

125
00:10:24,214 --> 00:10:25,924
Twenty-six years ago,

126
00:10:26,091 --> 00:10:30,387
they rose up together against the Grimalkine twins.

127
00:10:31,638 --> 00:10:35,475
Those two witches were responsible for much tragedy.

128
00:10:36,017 --> 00:10:38,478
After uncountable murders and plots,

129
00:10:39,020 --> 00:10:42,649
they managed to steal the throne of Bonta.

130
00:10:43,817 --> 00:10:48,780
Many of us supported your father and aunt's quest.

131
00:10:50,323 --> 00:10:53,034
The twins were especially powerful

132
00:10:53,201 --> 00:10:56,496
because they each had a Dofus.

133
00:10:57,539 --> 00:11:02,878
To defeat them, Zabelle and Kannell each had to get a Dofus as well.

134
00:11:03,420 --> 00:11:06,631
The battle was long, bitter and bloody,

135
00:11:06,798 --> 00:11:09,134
but our enemies were defeated.

136
00:11:10,427 --> 00:11:12,387
The heroes were acclaimed

137
00:11:12,554 --> 00:11:16,975
and crowned king and queen of Bonta and Amakna.

138
00:11:17,142 --> 00:11:21,396
The two kingdoms were at peace for just over ten years.

139
00:11:22,189 --> 00:11:25,525
But the two did not use their Dofus in the same way.

140
00:11:26,610 --> 00:11:31,281
Kannell understood that drawing on the power of a Dofus cut both ways.

141
00:11:32,032 --> 00:11:35,368
Zabelle, however, set no limits.

142
00:11:35,535 --> 00:11:37,787
Holder of the Ebony Dofus,

143
00:11:37,954 --> 00:11:40,290
she used its magic for everything.

144
00:11:40,665 --> 00:11:45,253
Making crops grow faster, forging magical weapons.

145
00:11:45,420 --> 00:11:49,549
An irreversible link grew progressively between her and Asalar.

146
00:11:50,175 --> 00:11:54,262
In the end, the queen and the dragon were one.

147
00:11:56,014 --> 00:11:57,390
Insidiously,

148
00:11:57,557 --> 00:12:00,560
Zabelle's thoughts turned ever more to domination,

149
00:12:00,727 --> 00:12:04,564
and she sought to take her brother's kingdom for herself.

150
00:12:13,239 --> 00:12:17,077
Zabelle, my beloved sister, there are other ways.

151
00:12:17,243 --> 00:12:21,039
Let's walk on the ramparts like we did as children

152
00:12:21,206 --> 00:12:22,999
and find a solution!

153
00:12:24,042 --> 00:12:27,587
Listen to me, please. Remember who we are!

154
00:12:28,046 --> 00:12:29,089
Kannell,

155
00:12:29,381 --> 00:12:31,341
calling on the past is useless.

156
00:12:31,758 --> 00:12:33,843
I can only see what I have become.

157
00:12:34,010 --> 00:12:36,346
I've failed, I admit.

158
00:12:36,513 --> 00:12:38,723
I should have listened long ago.

159
00:12:38,890 --> 00:12:42,269
But I've always been too stubborn.

160
00:12:43,269 --> 00:12:46,856
Please, Zabelle, it's not too late to get on the right track.

161
00:12:49,567 --> 00:12:51,736
Please, do not hold back in this fight!

162
00:13:05,917 --> 00:13:07,210
Enjoying yourself?

163
00:13:07,919 --> 00:13:10,714
I don't get to use my Dofus every day.

164
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:12,215
It's very exhilarating.

165
00:13:12,924 --> 00:13:15,677
I was in Queen Annette's chambers

166
00:13:15,844 --> 00:13:18,138
while she was in the throes of childbirth.

167
00:13:19,514 --> 00:13:23,351
Welsh, your mother was always incredibly sweet.

168
00:13:23,935 --> 00:13:27,605
She had the powers of her own clan, the Bellaphones.

169
00:13:28,273 --> 00:13:32,861
Your parents' love for each other had been sealed by a powerful spell.

170
00:13:33,862 --> 00:13:37,490
They shared all their pains, and all their thoughts.

171
00:13:37,866 --> 00:13:40,076
Their communion was absolute.

172
00:13:40,243 --> 00:13:42,287
So absolute that if one were to die,

173
00:13:42,746 --> 00:13:45,248
the other would die within minutes.

174
00:13:50,754 --> 00:13:52,589
Understand this, Welsh.

175
00:13:52,756 --> 00:13:55,759
Kannell wasn't fighting for himself alone.

176
00:13:55,925 --> 00:14:02,182
The lives of his wife and future child depended on his victory as well.

177
00:14:03,266 --> 00:14:04,225
Annette!

178
00:14:04,392 --> 00:14:07,145
Hold on, my love. The baby's almost here.

179
00:14:07,312 --> 00:14:09,564
Yes. Don't worry.

180
00:14:09,731 --> 00:14:11,608
I won't fall that easily.

181
00:14:12,525 --> 00:14:14,611
You don't look well.

182
00:14:15,111 --> 00:14:16,696
Annette is giving birth.

183
00:14:16,863 --> 00:14:19,115
Which means you'll be an auntie soon.

184
00:14:19,282 --> 00:14:20,116
What?

185
00:14:21,034 --> 00:14:23,870
Can't we postpone this little squabble?

186
00:14:24,037 --> 00:14:25,580
This is serious!

187
00:14:25,747 --> 00:14:29,626
Know that I absolutely intend to take your life, Kannell!

188
00:14:32,337 --> 00:14:34,631
And I won't leave until I've done so!

189
00:14:36,549 --> 00:14:38,468
The baby's almost here, Kannell.

190
00:14:38,635 --> 00:14:41,346
Remember, I feel everything, my dear.

191
00:14:41,513 --> 00:14:44,224
So this is what women endure during birth?

192
00:14:44,766 --> 00:14:46,101
Tell your friends.

193
00:14:46,267 --> 00:14:47,894
The head is crowning, push!

194
00:14:48,061 --> 00:14:50,647
Courage, darling. I'm with you!

195
00:15:04,077 --> 00:15:05,453
He has your nose.

196
00:15:05,620 --> 00:15:07,247
He's a beautiful boy.

197
00:15:08,665 --> 00:15:10,667
I'll be there as soon as I can,

198
00:15:10,834 --> 00:15:13,169
but first I must make Zabelle see reason.

199
00:15:13,336 --> 00:15:14,421
Be careful.

200
00:15:14,587 --> 00:15:16,339
She seems determined.

201
00:15:17,090 --> 00:15:20,176
My sister wouldn't dare follow through on her threats.

202
00:15:24,431 --> 00:15:26,224
We came into this world together.

203
00:15:54,419 --> 00:15:56,087
Zabelle, sister.

204
00:15:56,629 --> 00:15:59,090
The fight is finally over.

205
00:15:59,257 --> 00:16:00,800
Get up now

206
00:16:00,967 --> 00:16:02,719
and come greet your nephew.

207
00:16:03,344 --> 00:16:06,222
Clearly, you haven't heard a thing I've said.

208
00:16:09,976 --> 00:16:11,102
Stupid fool!

209
00:16:13,271 --> 00:16:15,106
Kannell, no!

210
00:16:19,777 --> 00:16:21,112
Don't look at me like that!

211
00:16:21,529 --> 00:16:24,115
I warned you multiple times.

212
00:16:24,491 --> 00:16:25,241
Zabelle.

213
00:16:35,251 --> 00:16:36,252
Master Joris!

214
00:16:37,128 --> 00:16:38,630
Take my baby, flee.

215
00:16:39,547 --> 00:16:41,174
Hide him.

216
00:16:41,799 --> 00:16:43,259
Protect him.

217
00:16:44,219 --> 00:16:45,511
Majesty!

218
00:16:52,977 --> 00:16:54,479
How is that possible?

219
00:16:54,646 --> 00:16:56,523
Even now, you smile!

220
00:16:57,065 --> 00:17:01,277
Because I know you'll never forgive yourself for this.

221
00:17:05,281 --> 00:17:07,659
I know, brother.

222
00:17:16,793 --> 00:17:18,127
Majesty!

223
00:17:31,599 --> 00:17:33,309
I love you, brother!

224
00:18:00,545 --> 00:18:02,088
EPISODE 3 A TASTE OF LICORICE

225
00:18:02,714 --> 00:18:06,593
I left you in the care of General Marmite.

226
00:18:06,759 --> 00:18:08,761
I was waiting until you came of age

227
00:18:08,928 --> 00:18:11,347
before coming to get you.

228
00:18:12,140 --> 00:18:15,852
Perhaps we should have told you all this sooner.

229
00:18:16,019 --> 00:18:19,522
You must understand, we hid your true origins from you

230
00:18:19,689 --> 00:18:21,858
purely to protect you.

231
00:18:23,776 --> 00:18:25,653
Zabelle is very powerful.

232
00:18:25,820 --> 00:18:27,989
She has spies everywhere.

233
00:18:28,156 --> 00:18:29,991
The fewer who knew your secret,

234
00:18:30,783 --> 00:18:35,288
the less chance there was of endangering your life by revealing it.

235
00:18:36,247 --> 00:18:37,707
I don't know how,

236
00:18:37,874 --> 00:18:41,127
but Zabelle finally got wind of your existence.

237
00:18:41,294 --> 00:18:45,006
In your family, your eyes are a unique shade of blue.

238
00:18:45,173 --> 00:18:48,259
Someone in Brassica must have noticed and warned her.

239
00:18:48,426 --> 00:18:49,510
That must be it.

240
00:18:50,803 --> 00:18:54,515
Only a handful of us knew the secret.

241
00:18:54,891 --> 00:18:57,643
If there had been a traitor among us,

242
00:18:57,810 --> 00:19:00,021
they would have acted long ago.

243
00:19:00,855 --> 00:19:02,857
And now? What do you want from me?

244
00:19:03,024 --> 00:19:06,152
That I fight my aunt you paint as an invincible witch?

245
00:19:06,694 --> 00:19:10,657
Even if I did manage to defeat her with my pots and pans and spoons,

246
00:19:11,032 --> 00:19:12,659
Me, a cook from Brassica...

247
00:19:13,201 --> 00:19:15,661
I don't know how to rule a kingdom!

248
00:19:17,372 --> 00:19:19,499
You seem to forget I'm just a kid!

249
00:19:19,665 --> 00:19:21,793
You'll send me to be slaughtered!

250
00:19:21,959 --> 00:19:23,294
Welsh...

251
00:19:23,920 --> 00:19:26,130
I'm done listening to this nonsense!

252
00:19:26,297 --> 00:19:27,548
What can I say?

253
00:19:27,965 --> 00:19:32,303
If you really were my parents' advisor, it's no surprise they are both dead!

254
00:19:42,397 --> 00:19:43,564
Ow!

255
00:19:44,357 --> 00:19:46,567
Does it look like I want to play, Bechamel?

256
00:19:46,943 --> 00:19:48,861
Come on, stop glowering!

257
00:19:49,028 --> 00:19:52,573
There are worse things than finding out you're a king.

258
00:19:52,949 --> 00:19:54,909
Are you serious, Becha?

259
00:19:55,076 --> 00:19:58,454
Go on then, take my place. Good luck with that!

260
00:19:58,830 --> 00:20:02,333
I've always said that I was an orphan, but what you don't know

261
00:20:03,209 --> 00:20:06,129
is that my village was along the black queen's path

262
00:20:06,295 --> 00:20:08,464
when she attacked Bonta.

263
00:20:09,465 --> 00:20:13,469
They took everything from us. All our food and the men able to fight.

264
00:20:14,554 --> 00:20:17,682
I ran away as soon as I had the chance.

265
00:20:19,767 --> 00:20:23,729
Unfortunately, so many others weren't nearly as lucky as I was.

266
00:20:23,896 --> 00:20:25,231
That's awful.

267
00:20:29,944 --> 00:20:33,781
What I'm trying to say, Welsh, is if you go on this adventure,

268
00:20:33,948 --> 00:20:36,117
I'm not afraid to go with you.

269
00:20:37,952 --> 00:20:39,996
Nothing to say? Really?

270
00:20:41,998 --> 00:20:43,124
Welsh!

271
00:20:55,887 --> 00:20:56,721
This way.

272
00:20:56,888 --> 00:20:59,015
How's the hunt going, Sipho?

273
00:21:00,099 --> 00:21:01,142
Who's there?

274
00:21:02,810 --> 00:21:05,688
Calm down. I'm not your enemy.

275
00:21:07,857 --> 00:21:08,900
Prince Shedar.

276
00:21:09,066 --> 00:21:11,736
Indeed. We haven't been properly introduced.

277
00:21:11,903 --> 00:21:15,323
I learned of you by spying on your father. He mistreats you.

278
00:21:15,490 --> 00:21:18,785
He gives me orders and I obey them, plain and simple.

279
00:21:18,951 --> 00:21:21,662
There's nothing more to be said about that.

280
00:21:22,038 --> 00:21:23,247
I see.

281
00:21:23,498 --> 00:21:25,917
Then let's not waste any time. Carry on.

282
00:21:26,334 --> 00:21:30,171
Father entrusted this mission to me and I must complete it alone.

283
00:21:30,338 --> 00:21:32,089
As you so rightly sniffed out,

284
00:21:32,256 --> 00:21:35,301
I am the prince. My orders supersede that dragon's.

285
00:21:36,302 --> 00:21:37,803
Don't worry too much.

286
00:21:37,970 --> 00:21:41,891
I just want to make sure my cousin will never become a real threat

287
00:21:42,058 --> 00:21:43,559
to my mother and her kingdom.

288
00:21:44,227 --> 00:21:46,562
Very well, Prince, as you like.

289
00:21:46,729 --> 00:21:50,316
But I won't slow down for you. You'll have to keep up.

290
00:21:52,068 --> 00:21:55,613
Friend, I've been keeping up for a hundred leagues already.

291
00:23:31,959 --> 00:23:35,421
Subtitling TITRAFILM

